Well, it seems the natural order of the universe has asserted itself. I've 
just ascended a (male) Valkyrie and there's almost exactly a million points 
difference between the two ascensions.

Its a while since I played a Valkyrie, but I selected a random character 
and got one, so apart from having to sort out the inappropriate gender for 
the name it was a fairly straightforward ascension.

Fun with Mojo: I discovered that its not a good idea throwing Mojo when 
confused (bye bye rings), and Newtons law kicks in when levitating, but not 
when levitating while stuck in a bear trap.

The scariest moment was on the plane of fire when I went and got stuck in 
the lava. I had ditched all the wands of digging after the plane of Earth, 
so I was reduced to a pickaxe.

